\newlabel{fig:phase3b_fitness}{{9}{16}{Phase~3b EA convergence (seed~0). Best-genome BLER (blue) converges to $5.8\times 10^{-2}$ after a single generation and does not improve further over 12 generations. The plateau criterion fires at generation~11}{figure.caption.21}{}}
